2.1 Enterprise Selection
Several livestock enterprises were considered before selecting the most appropriate one.
Enterprise	Advantages	Limitations
Dairy cattle	High milk demand	High capital and feed costs
Dairy goats	Drought tolerant	Limited local market
Rabbit production	Low feed requirement	Small market
Pig production	Fast growth	Cultural and environmental concerns
Improved Kienyeji broilers	High demand, hardy, good meat quality, climate resilient	Disease outbreaks if poorly managed
After evaluating all alternatives, improved Kienyeji chicken broiler production was selected because it best met the project objectives and matched the available resources.
